{
  "$comment": "Hand-kept facts of the App UI docs set (epic `epic-workflow`, P11):  the side column's groups, and one entry per page (title, summary, status, group;  `file`:  a Solid component file, from spell-app's root).  Read by `yarn site:data` (src/app/tools/AppUIDataBuilder.ts), never written.  Shape:  `AppUIPagesFile` in src/app/tools/tools.types.ts.  A new page:  add its entry here, run `yarn site:data`, then write its page as a copy of one like it (Notice.html:  a picture;  spell-viewer.html:  live), and link it from index.html.",
  "nav": {
    "start": [{ "id": "index", "file": "index.html", "label": "Overview", "icon": "house" }],
    "foundation": [],
    "titles": { "start": "App UI", "components": "Components" }
  },
